WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
We had the little school there, Mossville School.

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:13.260
I would say that my sister who was there as a baby, she was one of the first ones in our family . . . Well,

3
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:22.920
she was one of the ones that finished high school there before they integrated the school.

4
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:34.420
By time I got to the . . . I went to the elementary school there and we wind up being integrated when I was in the ninth grade.

5
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.780
They wound up moving us to Westlake High.

6
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:37.720
Oh my God.

7
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.280
That was horrible.

8
00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:43.220
And I laugh and I tell my kids I missed out on my education.

9
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:47.340
My four high school years from ninth grade to twelfth.

10
00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:50.400
I'll never forget the day, why . . . We begged them.

11
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.960
“Why couldn't Westlake come to our school?

12
00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.040
Why were they taking us from our school and bringing us to Westlake?”

13
00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.460
We didn't have no argument, you know.

14
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.680
It was just out.

15
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:08.080
Then after we got to Westlake High and . . . Do I say just really what happened?

16
00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:14.260
You want me to say that? [Laughs] When we pulled up on the bus at that school some of the white kids say,

17
00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:15.980
"Here come that bus load of niggers."

18
00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:18.580
That destroyed us.

19
00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:20.320
Because we didn't want to go at first.

20
00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:26.140
So then we . . . I had to wind up fighting the whole four years.

21
00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:33.540
Going to jail, being kicked out of school, fighting every day because they say,

22
00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:37.240
"Y'all not going to come here thinking this is y'alls school because this is not y'alls school.

23
00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.360
Y'all need to go back where y'all came from."
